{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53601","headline":"霍小玉歌 三 · 李惟","name":"霍小玉歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西北槛前挂鹦鹉，笼中报道李郎来。\n（见宋陈元龙《片玉集注》卷一《荔枝香》注引《丽情集》引《小玉歌》）（按：此诗作者之推定，与本书卷二十二崔珏《灼灼歌》相类，可参看。\n《新唐书》卷七二《宰相世系表》载李义琛孙、李绾子名惟，约爲盛君时人，当非此诗作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李惟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53601.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53601","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}